      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KAVA EXPRESS (5) recently joined the Jake Capewell stable, and put in a decent effort here 2 weeks ago when finishing fourth. She will be sharper for that effort, and in a modest field, she should go close to taking this out. MISHANI CABELLO (7) is still in her initial prep, and she has been thereabouts in 3 of her 5 starts, including a game nose defeat at Kilcoy just over 3 weeks ago. She again cops a tricky gate, but will benefit from a 1.5kg claim this time, and can go one better. CINCINNATI COBRA (1) resumed from a spell for the first time from the local Emma Ljung stable, and finished runner-up at a recent Stanthorpe picnic meeting. He had won a trial before that, and with the blinkers on for the first time, he should be hard to hold out. THE ONE (4) makes his Queensland debut after last being seen at Canberra over 1600m earlier in the month. He has a good gate, and can't be taken lightly. Check the market. ZOU ZOU ZIPORA (9) improved sharply when finishing third last start.",
